Package: txschools
Title: Polite, Reproducible Access to Texas Education Agency Public Performance Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "David",
           family = "Kahle",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "david.kahle@gmail.com")
Description: Tools for discovering, downloading, caching, parsing, and citing
    public school-performance data published by the Texas Education Agency
    (TEA), including the Texas Academic Performance Reports (TAPR), the
    School Report Card (SRC), and the Academic Excellence Indicator System
    (AEIS) archive. Downloads happen on demand against TEA's public pages;
    files are cached locally under 'tools::R_user_dir()' with source-URL,
    timestamp, and checksum metadata. TEA masking and suppression values
    are preserved exactly. This package is not affiliated with TEA and does
    not redistribute TEA datasets.
